The executable routine book_test uses set_precision.f90, dnrm2_testmod.f90,
dnrm2_support.f90, dnrm2_ieee.f90, c_control.c.  The modules IEEE_ARITHMETIC.f90,
IEEE_EXCEPTIONS.f90, IEEE_FEATURES.f90 are included for gfortran compiler usage
on x86 machines.  gfortran does not support these INTRINSIC modules at publication
time, 11/15/2013.

This is an output sample, using these modules and the Intel compiler
XE 14.0.1.139.
